WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
Welcome to PrepFord — one learning platform with two dedicated nursing pathways for NCLEX-RN and NCLEX-PN candidates.

00:07.000 --> 00:15.000
Start by selecting your licensure pathway: Registered Nurse (NCLEX-RN) or Practical Nurse (NCLEX-PN).

00:15.000 --> 00:23.000
Create an account or sign in securely to enter your dedicated learner dashboard.

00:23.000 --> 00:32.000
Inside the learner dashboard, review your active pathway, recent study activity, and recommended next steps.

00:32.000 --> 00:42.000
Open the question bank and select a practice examination or readiness assessment session.

00:42.000 --> 00:54.000
Read the clinical scenario carefully, review patient cues and vital signs, select your answer, and submit.

00:54.000 --> 01:06.000
Immediately review the correct-answer explanation alongside option-by-option distractor rationales.

01:06.000 --> 01:16.000
Connect concepts directly to PrepFord's 7-domain Nursing Study Guide and clinical notes.

01:16.000 --> 01:24.000
Track your domain accuracy, readiness assessments, and progress insights in your performance workspace.

01:24.000 --> 01:30.000
One learning platform. Two dedicated nursing pathways. Start preparing with PrepFord today.
